# Project Genesis

Project Genesis is an AI-Native Game Development Framework.

Main goals:

- Build reusable systems.
- Automate game development workflows.
- Create AI-assisted development pipelines.

When creating new capabilities:

Consider:

- Plugin architecture
- Reusability
- Documentation
- Automation

The framework should scale for years.

